Wild Rose is a 2018 musical drama film directed by Tom Harper and starring Jessie Buckley, Julie Walters, Sophie Okonedo, Jamie
Sives, Craig Parkinson, James Harkness, Janey Godley, Daisy Littlefield, Ryan Kerr, Adam Mitchell, and Nicole Kerr.

11
01:05:21,176 --> 01:05:27,176
The screenplay was written by Nicole Taylor.

12
01:11:17,647 --> 01:11:23,647
The film had its world premiere at the Toronto International Film Festival on 8 September 2018
and was released on 12 April 2019, by Entertainment One in the United Kingdom.

13
01:17:14,117 --> 01:17:20,117
The film received positive reviews, with Buckley earning a nomination for the
BAFTA Award for Best Actress in a Leading Role for her performance.

14
01:23:10,588 --> 01:23:16,588
A stage musical based on the film, received its world premiere in
March 2025 at the Royal Lyceum Theatre in Edinburgh.

15
